{"sections":[{"slug":"Feynmann路径积分","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Feynmann路径积分"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Feynmann <span lang=\"zh\">路径积分</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Feynmann 路径积分”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>Feynmann <span lang=\"zh\">路径积分是路径空间</span> (“<span lang=\"zh\">所有可能的路径</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">上的积分</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">描述了相互作用粒子系统的能量</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}